  "behaviour": [
    "Codes are 6 random digits, valid 10 minutes, 5 wrong tries then the code is dead (conventions.md, Signing in).",
    "Phone input is normalised to E.164 (default country NG) before lookup; email trimmed and lowercased.",
    "A new code invalidates the previous unconsumed code for the same destination.",
    "Delivery goes through messages-sms first, messages-whatsapp as the second way (conventions.md), messages-email for email.",
    "Rate limits per destination and per IP (PROVISIONAL figures below); a limited request answers error code 'too_many_requests' with retryAfter.",
    "Codes are compared in constant time against a peppered hash (AUTH_CODE_PEPPER).",
    "Replaces STUB-2: any six digits never sign anyone in."
